{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Tortillini glances over at him, but doesn't speak. Instead a minor illusion of a napkin with scrawled text materializes infront of Apgan\n\n```Now what good would a pirate's reputation be if he couldn't build upon it. An' who might you be?```","created_at":"2021-07-11T22:37:35.391000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863911932398665798","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Apgan. You've seen the posters. Look, I figure the rebellion may become interested in you, making all this fuss. I'd appreciate if you let them know I'm looking for work. If that's all right with you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T22:39:29.886000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863912412624191518","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"```It'd be me pleasure Master Apgan. What brings ye to this dingy city?```","created_at":"2021-07-11T22:41:23.964000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T22:41:59.284000Z","id":"863912891103051776","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"If you're looking for a name I want be known by for the rebellion, call me Bessie. I'm in the city because if you can make it here, you must really be special. It's the only place to really make a fortune. If you want to know why I'm in this bar, I could use a distinguishing scar.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T22:42:49.075000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T23:17:46.904000Z","id":"863913248083148810","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Figured Heore could do the job.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T22:43:16.048000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863913361216503829","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"```Bessie tis then! Knowing er she'll be glad to oblige```","created_at":"2021-07-11T22:43:51.620000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863913510416154634","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"```An' depending on er price I'd help ye out meself``` he takes a dagger out and spins it from the pommel absently on the bar before sheathing it","created_at":"2021-07-11T22:44:40.900000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T22:45:03.910000Z","id":"863913717111848983","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Apgan thinks for a moment. \"She'd have to charge a pretty penny for me to take you up on that offer. But don't count it out.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T22:45:53.010000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863914019563372594","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Tortillini squawks a laugh","created_at":"2021-07-11T22:46:12.288000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863914100420509696","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
